Replaces: nvidia-legacy-driver
Description: NVIDIA legacy 580.95.05 driver metapackage (Maxwell, Pascal, Volta (GeForce GTX 700/900/1000, TITAN V))
 The 580.95.05 driver from the NVIDIA 580xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for bookworm.
 .
 Supported hardware: Maxwell, Pascal, Volta (GeForce GTX 700/900/1000, TITAN V).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Last driver branch for Maxwell/Pascal/Volta. NVIDIA still ships kernel-compat + security fixes here (the 590 branch drops these GPUs). Track upstream respins.


Package: nvidia-legacy-580xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-580xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 580.95.05 driver — core runtime libraries
 Shared libraries used by the NVIDIA 580.95.05 driver: libnvidia-glcore,
 libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore and friends. Install the :i386 variant
 alongside for 32-bit OpenGL applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-580xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 580.95.05 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings' backend, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump and
 the nvidia-persistenced daemon for the 580.95.05 driver.

