Section: non-free/libs
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, nvidia-legacy-580xx-driver-libs (= ${binary:Version})
Provides: libgl1-nvidia-glx
Description: NVIDIA legacy 580.95.05 driver — libGL / GLX
 The NVIDIA implementation of libGL and the GLX extension for the 580.95.05
 driver, wired through glvnd where the distro provides it.

